<BaseLayout title="About" description="About The Deterministic Boundary, an independent publication by dimpac.">
  <article class="standard-page shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Reasoning at the boundary.</h1>
    <div class="standard-copy">
      <p>
        <em>The Deterministic Boundary</em> is an independent publication exploring knowledge, intelligence, artificial intelligence, and knowledge graphs.
      </p>
      <p>
        It examines how probabilistic systems meet the deterministic demands of reliable engineering: explicit constraints, verifiable behavior, and systems that remain understandable when uncertainty cannot be eliminated.
      </p>
      <p>
        The focus is on careful technical reasoning, practical architecture, and better ways to make decisions under uncertainty. Articles are published under the pseudonym <strong>dimpac</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
